optflags: alpha -O6 -Wa,-mev56

Compiled and installed everything and I can say:
Good Points:
	-Window resizing now works
	-Hasn't crashed yet
	-Renders more content correctly. (about 20% over M3)
	-Quick, real quick
Bad Points
	-Forms don't work
	-Renders buttons incorrectly
	-Cannot open files correctly
	-Cannot render http://www.alphalinux.org
	-Load status bars between windows are tied together.

Overall:
  My biggest disapointment is the fact buttons ergo forms don't work.
