handle forms I am stuck running the intel version of Netscape. I would
say it feels faster than the M3 release and has a good future. I am
encouraged by the steady releases and am looking forward to thee day I can:

  command://rm -rf /usr/local/netscape.3.04

I would say if you would like to play or try out the next version
go ahead and download it. But if you use forms ergo on-line
shoping, ebay, cnn, slashdot, deja news. It just will not
work for you.

